{
  "endpoint": "https://api.startupstats.com/v1/startups",
  "method": "GET",
  "description": "Retrieves a list of startups along with key metrics such as funding rounds, valuation, employee count, and industry classification.",
  "example_usage": {
    "request": {
      "method": "GET",
      "url": "https://api.startupstats.com/v1/startups?search=fintech&limit=10",
      "headers": {
        "Accept": "application/json",
        "Authorization": "Bearer YOUR_API_KEY"
      }
    },
    "response": {
      "status_code": 200,
      "body": {
        "data": [
          {
            "name": "FinTech Innovators Inc.",
            "industry": "Financial Services",
            "funding_rounds": 3,
            "total_funding_usd": 12000000,
            "valuation_usd": 50000000,
            "employees": 45,
            "headquarters": "San Francisco, CA",
            "website": "https://www.fintechinnovators.com"
          },
          {
            "name": "NextGen Payments",
            "industry": "Payments",
            "funding_rounds": 2,
            "total_funding_usd": 8000000,
            "valuation_usd": 30000000,
            "employees": 30,
            "headquarters": "New York, NY",
            "website": "https://www.nextgenpayments.com"
          }
        ],
        "pagination": {
          "page": 1,
          "per_page": 10,
          "total_pages": 5,
          "total_records": 50
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**How to use this API**

1. **Register** for an API key at https://api.startupstats.com/signup.  
2. Include the key in the `Authorization` header as shown above.  
3. Adjust query parameters (`search`, `industry`, `location`, `min_funding`, `max_funding`, `limit`, `page`) to filter results.  
4. Parse the JSON response to extract startup metrics for analysis, dashboards, or integration into your own services.
